  "snippet": "Arctic sea ice extent dropped from 12.841 to 11.439 million km² in May 2026, approaching record low territory. ICESat-2 laser altimetry confirmed thin ice conditions in the Barents Sea region. AMSR-2 passive microwave and Sentinel-1 SAR data cross-verified the extent measurements. NSIDC and NASA published official assessments.",
